{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51727","headline":"灵岩秋月 · 冯铢","name":"灵岩秋月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青松崖上紫云生，崖下仙人约旧盟。\n驻马看碑惊化鹤，暮云回首万家城。\n（《蜀中名胜记》八《成都府·资县》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯铢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51727.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51727","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}